        "note_tweet": {
          "entities": {},
          "text": "I’ve seen this videos floating around this site with a lot of rumors & nasty stuff aimed at him.\n\nI actually had the pleasure of meeting this kid recently.\n\nHe’s not a “Kaifeng Jew,” and he’s not serving in the IDF. The uniform belongs to Sar-El, an Israeli volunteer program.\n\nWhat he is though, is a bright and special young man who’s felt a strong pull to learn about Judaism & possibly convert.\n\nTruth be told, I saw a bit of my 18-year-old-self in him, when left home for a foreign land & started a journey I never looked back.\n\nI told him that whether he ends up converting or not, good things are ahead for him. God has a way of guiding people onto the path meant for them - a path only they can forge.\n\nFolks like him are immune to haters."
